OL,3,GNEWSABoxing trainer to be inducted into
OL,4,AHall of Fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sheffield boxing trainer is to be
OL,7,Finducted into the British Boxing Hall
OL,8,Fof Fame.
OL,10,FGlyn Rhodes MBE began his career in the
OL,11,Fring aged 19 under the tutelage of
OL,12,Flegendary coach Brendan Ingle and now
OL,13,Fruns Sheffield Boxing Centre, which has
OL,14,Fproduced numerous champions.
OL,16,FRhodes will be honoured at a ceremony
OL,17,Fnext year which celebrates figures in
OL,18,Fthe boxing world who have made a
OL,19,Flasting contribution to the sport.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
