OL,3,GNEWSABoxing trainer to be inducted into
OL,4,AHall of Fame
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 66-year-old described the news as
OL,7,Fboth "tremendous" and "surreal",
OL,8,Fadding: "This is voted for by people in
OL,9,Fboxing, your peers in the game. That
OL,10,Fmakes it special."
